# onnxruntime-node (transitive dep of @imgly/background-removal-node in
# erxes-agent_api) postinstalls the full CUDA GPU tarball on linux/x64 unless
# told not to. This is a CPU-only monorepo — skip it everywhere a root
# `pnpm install` runs (all 26 CI workflows, local linux dev, Docker builds).
# The install script reads this via the npm_config_* lifecycle env.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
